ChildVault_recoverFailedEpochWithdraw
├── when there is no pending recovery
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoPendingRecovery
├── when there is no active adapter
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoActiveAdapter
├── when adapter withdraw reverts
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__WithdrawFailed
├── when adapter withdraw returns zero
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__ZeroRecoveryAmount
└── when recovery succeeds
    ├── it should withdraw from the active adapter
    ├── it should bridge withdrawn USDC to Parent
    ├── it should store the epoch nonce
    ├── it should clear recovery state
    ├── it should emit WithdrawFromStrategySuccess
    └── it should emit EpochWithdrawRecoveryCleared
